erver champion, the warrior who brought the Swamp Corruptor to their knees!","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":14,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_SpBoss_Top.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_SpBossBD_Top.png","NodeSize":[449,220],"ShowType":"Top"},"30005":{"ID":30005,"Type":"SpBossDailyChange","ParamType":"2","ShareTarget":"Global","TriggerCondition":["1","11"],"Content":"Yesterday, players across all servers dealt {0} damage to the Swamp Corruptor.","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":1,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_SpBoss_Daily_Change.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_SpBossBD_Daily_Change.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"30006":{"ID":30006,"Type":"SpBossFinal","ParamType":"2","ShareTarget":"Global","TriggerCondition":["13"],"Content":"Yesterday, players across all servers eliminated the Swamp Corruptor.","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":1,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_SpBoss_Daily_Change.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_SpBossBD_Daily_Change.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19022":{"ID":19022,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"164","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"Not long ago, three ominous meteors arrived in Esperia. One of them, which had fallen on the borders of the Lightbearer Empire, dissipated under the blade of the Harbinger of Justice. It is unknown what turmoil will ensue from the other two…","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19023":{"ID":19023,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"139","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"Unrest has been rife among the Sphinxes recently. Mayhaps they are in major trouble. After all, the Arachin Queen, with whom they have entered into a pact, is wildly ambitious.","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19024":{"ID":19024,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"131","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"Do you know what I saw? A meteor falling onto the territory of the Sphinxes. But there were no Sphinxes nearby, only the Arachin! Looks like a dispute is imminent. I have got to report this!","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19025":{"ID":19025,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"154","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"I rarely get a chance to watch a meteor, but mommy and daddy are not watching it with me. They even forbid me from going out, saying it's dangerous… How odd!","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19026":{"ID":19026,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"42","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"The star that has fallen into the lake carries a dark force. All the surrounding trees are withering and their fruits decaying… Is the Dark Forest on the brink of an ill-fated disaster?","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19027":{"ID":19027,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"6","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"Bad meteor! My friends… look so different now… so many… Hypogeans… Ogi is… angry! Bad things… go away!","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19028":{"ID":19028,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"61","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"On this year's Noctis Animarum, the Prince and Her Ladyship are also organizing an epic event to let the children of Oakenfell have a wonderful festive time. Thanks to Mr. Oscar, all the preparations are proceeding smoothly.","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19029":{"ID":19029,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"90","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"A few days ago, a weird gentleman kept staring at me and Stitchy and asking me how Stitchy could move. But no matter how hard I explained, he still could not understand.","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""},"19030":{"ID":19030,"Type":"ActivityPainting","ParamType":"91","ShareTarget":"ActivityPainting","TriggerCondition":[],"Content":"It is said that some of the souls trapped in the Realm of Denial have the chance to be free of incarnation at the new beginning, while some will cling onto their obsessive thoughts and carry on into their next mortal life.","DisplayTab":true,"SelfHide":false,"Level":4,"TopTime":86400,"Days":3,"Csd":"res\/uieditor\/news\/News_NPC.csb","BannerBackground":"res\/ui\/panel\/news\/news_NPC.png","NodeSize":[449,146],"ShowType":""}}}}